    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "ULTRAKILL\n\nA GAME CREATED BY <color=orange>ARSI \"HAKITA\" PATALA</color>\n\nWITH THE HELP OF:\n\n<color=orange>DAVE OSHRY</color> (EXECUTIVE PRODUCER)\n<color=orange>PITR</color> (PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>VICTORIA HOLLAND</color> (3D ARTIST & SHADER PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>SAMUEL JAMES BRYAN</color> (3D ARTIST)\n<color=orange>BIGROCKBMP</color> (CONCEPT ARTIST)\n<color=orange>JERICHO_RUS</color> (ILLUSTRATOR, CONCEPT & TEXTURE ARTIST)\n<color=orange>FRANCIS XIE</color> (CONCEPT & TEXTURE ARTIST)\n\n\n\nWITH ADDITIONAL CONTRIBUTIONS BY:\n\n<color=orange>MAXIMILIAN OVESSON</color> (UI ARTIST)\n<color=orange>JACOB H.H.R.</color> (WRITER [PROSE & DIALOGUE])\n<color=orange>FLYINGDOG</color> (3D ARTIST)\n<color=orange>TONI STIGELL</color> (3D ARTIST)\n<color=orange>BEN MOIR</color> (PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>LUCAS VARNEY</color> (PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>EMANUIL \"CABALCROW\" CHIZHOV</color> (PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>HECKTECK</color> (PROGRAMMER)\n<color=orange>MEGANEKO</color> (CYBER GRIND MUSIC COMPOSER)"
